                    <chunk name="param_input" index="3">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Preserve source mass per length: replacement density = source density * source area / replacement area. Prevents transformed concrete area being counted as steel self-weight. Elastic properties are unchanged.</item>
